          <Dialog>After getting a girlfriend, 
I'm sure my life will 
change somehow.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What do I do now？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>......</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Should I go over how things
work from here on？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Check, just to be safe</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No need, I've got it</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right. I'd better take 
a look. This will be like 
practice.</Dialog>
