course.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>When the mood's right, I can
get close to her...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>If things go well, I might 
even get to kiss her！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But of course, I probably 
won't master it on the 
first try.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>If I don't work on myself
first, I'll probably go on a
date and not manage
anything.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>So first, I'll decide on
today's plans...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No need. I've already got it
figured out.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Now then, I need to decide 
what I'll do today.</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
